Title: THE EXACT ONE
Credit: Written by
Author: Brandon Bradshaw
Source: A concept film for Drop Assassin
Draft date: Revision 3, 2026-11-13. Unapproved draft.
Notes: This is the approval screenplay for a Drop Assassin concept film: Creative Director revision 3, 2026-11-13. It is unapproved and Research has not countersigned it. No assets, renders or file changes.

!OPENING CARD (0:00–0:04)

!Black #0A0A0C, gold type:

> A concept film. App screens are designed for this film. <
> Screens marked Upcoming preview show planned features. <

.INT. ALEX'S APARTMENT - NIGHT #1#

= 0:04–0:40 · TOO LATE

!Interior, Alex's apartment, night. A desk lamp lights the shelf that returns in every later shot: Harbor Lantern on the left, Redline Racer on the right, and every other box turned away.

!Alex sits at the desk with the phone already in his right hand, waiting. He refreshes a blurred feed with nothing legible on it, and drums his left fingers once on the desk.

!A notification drops onto the white UI:

!    Alerts
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Standard
    Now available.

!He taps it the instant it lands. A white store page loads, with no store name:

!    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Standard
    Sold out
    *Story plate. Not a recorded stock event.*

!His thumb stops. No clock or timestamp is shown.

ALEX
It just came in.
(beat)
And it's already gone.

!He backs out. The home screen shows no Drop Assassin icon.

!TRANSITION: He was holding the phone the whole time, so the alert was the slow part. Cut on his thumb moving to search.

.INT. ALEX'S APARTMENT - NIGHT #2#

= 0:40–1:20 · ALERTS THAT KEEP UP

!Same desk, same night. He searches for and picks Drop Assassin. No store page, reviews or other app names appear.

!    Drop Assassin
    Alerts, your collection, and the exact hunt.
    Button: Get started

!    Intel
    Watch a drop
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Standard
    Drop and restock alerts

!The switch starts off, and his thumb turns it on. Under it, with the gold chip:

!    Upcoming preview
    Goal: an alert within seconds of a drop or restock.
    Design target. Not a measured guarantee.
    An alert is not a promise the listing is still there.

ALEX
(half to himself)
Within seconds. That's what I've been looking for.

!    Button: Continue

!TRANSITION: The watch is set, but his collection lives only on the shelf. He reaches for a box he already owns.

.INT. ALEX'S APARTMENT - NIGHT #3#

= 1:20–2:14 · WHAT HE ALREADY OWNS

!Same night. His left hand turns the Harbor Lantern box so its barcode faces the phone in his right hand. Both hands show five fingers, and the box edges stay clear of his skin. He is scanning a box he owns, not either Violet Lantern.

!    Add to collection · Upcoming preview
    Scan a barcode
    Hold the code in the frame.

!A plain bracket appears on screen. The barcode digits are never shown large or legible. The scan suggests a match, and nothing is added until he confirms it.

!    Is this the one? · Upcoming preview
    Thrilljoy Harbor Lantern Standard
    Confirm before it's added.
    Buttons: This is it · Not this one

!He checks the box face against the plate and taps This is it.

!    Added
    Thrilljoy Harbor Lantern Standard
    Owned by Alex Rivera
    Quantity: 1

ALEX
Harbor Lantern. That one I've got.

!He puts it back on the left, then scans and confirms Redline Racer the same way. The boxes never touch.

!    Added
    Funko Pop! Redline Racer
    Owned by Alex Rivera
    Quantity: 1

!    Body Count
    Your collection
    Thrilljoy Harbor Lantern Standard · Owner: Alex Rivera
    Funko Pop! Redline Racer · Owner: Alex Rivera

!He looks from the screen to the shelf: the same two names.

ALEX
Those two are mine.

!TRANSITION: Next he wants to know what the shelf is worth.

.INT. ALEX'S APARTMENT - NIGHT #4#

= 2:14–2:56 · WHAT IT'S WORTH

!Same night.

!    Collection value · Upcoming preview
    Sample figures. Not market data.
    Resale estimate and retail reference stay in separate columns.
    A figure appears only when a source backs it. Unknown stays unknown.

!Columns: Item · Resale estimate · Retail reference · Freshness · Source

!Rows:

!    Thrilljoy Harbor Lantern Standard · Sample figure · Sample figure · Sample date · Sample source
    Funko Pop! Redline Racer · Unknown · Unknown · No reading yet · Not enough evidence

!Totals:

!    Total resale estimate · Sample figure · Covers 1 of 2 items
    Total retail reference · Sample figure · Covers 1 of 2 items

!    Footer: A resale estimate is not a retail reference. Neither is a promise of a sale.

!"Sample figure" is set as words, with no digits. Neither Violet Lantern has a row, because he owns neither.

ALEX
One backed, one blank. Better than a made-up number.

!TRANSITION: He scrolls to the rest of the collection tools.

.INT. ALEX'S APARTMENT - NIGHT #5#

= 2:56–3:22 · BRING THE REST

!Same night.

!    Import a collection · Upcoming preview
    Bring a collection from a supported app.
    Each item is previewed and confirmed before it is added.
    No file is selected.

!Below the fold, Body Count is unchanged: Thrilljoy Harbor Lantern Standard and Funko Pop! Redline Racer.

ALEX
Good. Later.

!He backs out. No other app opens, and no second collection appears.

!TRANSITION: The shelf is logged, and what he really wants is the rare one. He opens Hunt.

.INT. ALEX'S APARTMENT - NIGHT #6#

= 3:22–4:34 · THE EXACT NAME

!Same night. The Harbor Lantern box stays sharp at frame left, out of his hands.

!    Hunt
    Find the exact one

!The field fills as he types: Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Chase

!    Button: Lock On

!    Locked on
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Chase
    This target is not in your collection.

ALEX
Not the standard. The chase.

!    Matches · Upcoming preview

!He scrolls through three cards. None shows a price, a stock count or a sold-out stamp.

!**Card one:**

!    Retailer
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Chase
    Listing names this variant. Edition not verified.
    Status: not stated
    *Story plate. Not a recorded stock event.*

!**Card two:**

!    eBay
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Chase
    Listing names this variant. Edition not verified.
    Price: not shown
    This is not a completed sale.

!**Card three** (with the concept caption):

!    Member collection
    JH · Jordan Hale
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Chase
    Discoverable listing

!He stops on the third card.

ALEX
Somebody actually has one.

!He opens it:

!    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Chase
    Owned by Jordan Hale. Not owned by Alex Rivera.
    Condition note from Jordan: Sealed box.
    Drop Assassin has not verified this item.
    No contact details on this listing.
    Button: Send an offer
    *Concept sequence. Not a shipped screen.*

!TRANSITION: He can ask Jordan, but he cannot pay inside the app. Cut on his thumb over Send an offer.

.INT. ALEX'S APARTMENT - NIGHT #7#

= 4:34–5:46 · ASK, THEN BOTH AGREE

!Same night. The concept caption stays under every plate in this scene, including Jordan's insert.

!Alex's phone:

!    Member Match
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Chase
    To: Jordan Hale
    Your offer: I want this exact chase. Can we arrange an exchange?
    Share my contact with Jordan Hale only if Jordan accepts.
    alex.rivera@example.com · Selected.
    Drop Assassin does not take payment, hold the item, or ship it.
    Button: Send offer

ALEX
If they say yes, they get my email. That's it.

!He taps Send offer:

!    Offer sent
    Waiting for Jordan Hale
    Your contact stays private until Jordan also agrees.

!Hard cut to the screen-only insert: a second black phone fills the frame, with no hand, no person and nothing from Alex's room.

!    Caption: Jordan's phone
    Interest
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Chase
    Alex Rivera wants to arrange an exchange.
    No contact details on this notice.
    Accept and share my contact with Alex Rivera.
    jordan.hale@example.com · Selected.
    Buttons: Accept · Decline

!The Accept button presses in.

!Hard cut back to Alex, phone in his right hand. A banner arrives, with no contact details on it:

!    Member Match
    Jordan Hale accepted your offer.
    Open your private match.

!He opens it:

!    Contact shared
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Chase
    You both agreed to share.
    Alex Rivera: alex.rivera@example.com
    Jordan Hale: jordan.hale@example.com
    Arrange the exchange between yourselves.
    Drop Assassin does not take payment, hold the item, or ship it.

ALEX
(a small breath)
Okay. Jordan.

!The shelf is unchanged. Nothing has changed hands.

!TRANSITION: The chase is now between Alex and Jordan. The drop he missed is still on his Intel watch.

DISSOLVE TO:

.INT. ALEX'S APARTMENT - NEXT EVENING #8#

= 5:46–6:58 · IN TIME

!A 12-frame dissolve to a typeset card reading "The next evening." Same apartment, hoodie, face and shelf.

!Alex is at the desk, mid-bite of dinner, with the phone face-up beside the plate. It lights up, and he picks it up in his right hand.

!    Intel
    Restock alert
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Standard
    Open it and check.
    An alert is not a promise the listing is still there.

!He taps it straight away:

!    Retailer
    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Standard
    Listing names this variant.
    Button: Open at retailer
    *Story plate. Not a recorded stock event.*

!He taps Open at retailer. The white store page loads, with no store name:

!    Thrilljoy Violet Lantern Standard
    Available
    Button: Add to cart
    *Story plate. Not a recorded stock event.*

!He taps Add to cart:

!    Added to cart

!He breathes out and smiles. Checkout happens at the store, off screen, and the shelf stays the same.

ALEX
Still there this time.

!He sets the phone down. With his left hand he props the printed card in front of the shelf, clear of both boxes:

!    Violet Lantern Chase · Jordan

!Harbor Lantern stays on the left and Redline Racer on the right. Neither Violet Lantern is ever a box in the room.

!End card (logo only from Brandon's approved file):

> THE EXACT ONE <
> Drop Assassin <
> Get the alert. Hunt the exact one. Keep the whole shelf. <
